OL,3,AChild ketamine users getting bladder
OL,4,Adamage describe 'peeing a jellyfish'
OL,5,
OL,6,FChildren as young as 13 are getting
OL,7,Fketamine bladder damage, doctors
OL,8,Frunning the UK's first and only
OL,9,Fdedicated NHS clinic for it have told
OL,10,Fthe BBC in an exclusive interview.
OL,12,FMedics at Alder Hey Hospital in
OL,13,FLiverpool say some patients - they have
OL,14,Fhad over 100 referrals since opening
OL,15,Flast May - describe 'peeing a
OL,16,Fjellyfish', which is some of the
OL,17,Fbladder's protective lining being shed.
OL,19,FProlonged damage can lead to
OL,20,Fincontinence or uncontrolled peeing,
OL,21,Fand even kidney failure.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
